{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34409","headline":"顷自桐江得一钓车以袭美乐烟波之思因出以爲玩俄辱三篇复抒酬荅 三 · 陆龟蒙","name":"顷自桐江得一钓车以袭美乐烟波之思因出以爲玩俄辱三篇复抒酬荅 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病来县着脆缗丝，独喜高情爲我持。\n数幅尚凝烟雨态，三篇能赋蕙兰词。\n云深石静闲眠稳，月上江平放溜迟。\n第一莫教谙此境，倚天功业待君爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34409.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34409","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}